==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|ang}} ''[[hræfter]]''.

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# In time to come; in some future time or state.
#* Dryden:
#*: '''Hereafter''' he from war shall come.
# [[from now on|From now on]]

